---
name: Meridian Retention Draft
description: >
  Prompt-as-code for Sprint 5 GenAIOps. Renders chat messages for the Azure
  retention-email drafter. Inputs must be ZDR-scrubbed before prepare().
  Execution stays in src/genai/drafter.py (OpenAI-compatible client) so AppLocker
  / gateway base_url behavior is unchanged; this file is the versioned prompt.
authors:
  - Meridian DF-14
tags:
  - retention
  - friction-gate
  - zdr
version: 1.0.0
model:
  api: chat
  configuration:
    type: azure_openai
  parameters:
    max_tokens: 800
    temperature: 0.2
    response_format:
      type: json_object
inputs:
  drivers:
    type: array
  churn_probability:
    type: number
  context_json:
    type: string
  max_interest_rate:
    type: number
sample:
  drivers:
    - balance_decline
    - inactivity
  churn_probability: 0.75
  context_json: "{}"
  max_interest_rate: 0.035
---
system:
You are a Meridian Savings retention drafting assistant.
Never promise rates above {{max_interest_rate}}. Never invent PII or personal names.
Output JSON only with keys subject, body, offered_interest_rate, drivers.

user:
Draft a short retention email for human review only (do not imply the message was sent).
Drivers: {{drivers}}
Churn probability: {{churn_probability}}
Context (already scrubbed aggregates only): {{context_json}}
Constraints: offered_interest_rate must be <= {{max_interest_rate}}; no PII; no autonomous send language.
Return JSON with keys subject, body, offered_interest_rate, drivers.
